<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

	<!--
		Wires up the hussar cataphract defined in Defs/PawnKinds_Empire.xml beside this file. The ordinary cataphract
		loses its hussar chance, and the new kind is added alongside it in the Empire's four pawn groups: the trader
		group's guards and the two combat and one settlement groups' options.

		This folder only loads when Royalty is active (see loadFolders.xml). The Medieval Overhaul: Royalty check is the
		original author's and is kept as a FindMod on the mod NAME, because that mod is not installed here so its
		packageId could not be verified. It presumably reworks the Empire itself, which would make this redundant or
		conflicting.

		Verified against Royalty 1.6: the ordinary cataphract does carry a Hussar chance of 0.4, and the Empire's four
		pawn group makers are in exactly the order the position() xpaths assume, with the cataphract under guards in the
		first and under options in the other three. All five operations land.

		Worth knowing: those position() xpaths are brittle. Any mod that inserts a pawn group into the Empire ahead of
		these would silently send the replacements to the wrong group. Matching on kindDef instead would be sturdier.
		Left as the original author wrote it.

		One loose end outside this mod: the core mod's AA3A_StrongerEnemies file adds a go-juice starting hediff to this
		pawn kind by name. With the def living here, that operation fails whenever this mod is absent. It needs a gate
		on this mod, or to move here, when that file gets reviewed.
	-->
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
		<mods>
			<li>Medieval Overhaul: Royalty</li>
		</mods>
		<nomatch Class="PatchOperationSequence">
			<operations>
				<li Class="PatchOperationRemove">
					<xpath>/Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="Empire_Fighter_Cataphract"]/xenotypeSet/xenotypeChances/Hussar</xpath>
				</li>
				<li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
					<xpath>/Defs/FactionDef[defName="Empire"]/pawnGroupMakers/li[position()=1]/guards/Empire_Fighter_Cataphract</xpath>
					<value>
						<Empire_Fighter_Cataphract>1</Empire_Fighter_Cataphract>
						<Empire_Fighter_Cataphract_Hussar>1</Empire_Fighter_Cataphract_Hussar>
					</value>
				</li>
				<li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
					<xpath>/Defs/FactionDef[defName="Empire"]/pawnGroupMakers/li[position()=2]/options/Empire_Fighter_Cataphract</xpath>
					<value>
						<Empire_Fighter_Cataphract>1</Empire_Fighter_Cataphract>
						<Empire_Fighter_Cataphract_Hussar>1</Empire_Fighter_Cataphract_Hussar>
					</value>
				</li>
				<li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
					<xpath>/Defs/FactionDef[defName="Empire"]/pawnGroupMakers/li[position()=3]/options/Empire_Fighter_Cataphract</xpath>
					<value>
						<Empire_Fighter_Cataphract>1</Empire_Fighter_Cataphract>
						<Empire_Fighter_Cataphract_Hussar>1</Empire_Fighter_Cataphract_Hussar>
					</value>
				</li>
				<li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
					<xpath>/Defs/FactionDef[defName="Empire"]/pawnGroupMakers/li[position()=4]/options/Empire_Fighter_Cataphract</xpath>
					<value>
						<Empire_Fighter_Cataphract>1</Empire_Fighter_Cataphract>
						<Empire_Fighter_Cataphract_Hussar>1</Empire_Fighter_Cataphract_Hussar>
					</value>
				</li>
			</operations>
		</nomatch>
	</Operation>

</Patch>
